<title>USA: Pakistan buys 31,412 tonnes of U.S. soybeans-agent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys 31,412 tonnes of U.S. soybeans-agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan bought 31,412 tonnes of U.S. number two yellow soybeans under the PL-480 program from Cargill Inc for $303.19 per tonne, FOB U.S. Gulf, agents for the buyer said.</p>
<p>The soybeans were slated for October 15-30 shipment.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
